 "wiki_summary_ultravox": {
  "type": "standard",
  "title": "Ultravox",
  "description": "British new wave band",
  "extract": "Ultravox were a British new wave band, formed in London in April 1974 as Tiger Lily. Between 1980 and 1986, they scored seven top ten albums and seventeen top 40 singles in the UK, the most successful of which was their 1981 hit \"Vienna\".",
